{"id":"chimenea","lemma":"chimenea","pos":"noun","rank":3238,"glosses":["chimney","smokestack (of a train or factory)","funnel (of a ship)"],"ipa":"/t͡ʃimeˈnea/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"chimeneas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-chimenea.wav","examples":[{"text":"Un humo negro salió de la chimenea.","en":"Black smoke came out of the chimney.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514768","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"smoke"},{"g":"black (absorbing all…"},{"g":"to go out","l":"salir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]},{"text":"Esa chimenea es muy alta.","en":"That chimney is very high.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551543","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"certificate of discharge"}]},{"text":"La chimenea está hecha de ladrillo.","en":"The chimney is made of brick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642084","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"done, completed","l":"hecho"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"brick"}]},{"text":"Desde la ventana se ven las chimeneas de la fábrica.","en":"You can see the smokestacks of the factory from the window.","words":[{"g":"since"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"window"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"the / them"},null,null,null,{"g":"factory"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"of the"]]},{"text":"Se sentaron junto a la chimenea.","en":"They sat by the fireplace.","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"next to, alongside"]]}]}